    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — CONTEXT-DISCIPLINE SANDBOX IS NOT IN CURRENT RUNTIME\n\nFresh main `6caaf1de92557e96770f6a6dd275d69f49742458` code search returns no active `hq_pre_action.py` and no `context_packet` call path. Fresh `AGENTS.md` now uses direct mandatory GitHub boot/evidence restoration and explicitly removed mandatory Night School/runtime-learning machinery.\n\nTherefore the 125-commit sandbox Context Discipline stack is not a current security/runtime dependency. Porting it would reintroduce an unused process layer contrary to the Constitution simplest-sufficient-system and stop-rule laws.\n\nHistorical RED/GREEN evidence remains valuable as design/security history; no claim is made that those sandbox checks are active in main.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL SANDBOX`.",
