    "body": "Implementation candidate for approved design PR #240. Base = duncan/sandbox exact HEAD 28bca057b06eadff8759aa895d744d46266006a0. Reuses existing Unified Archive / FTS5 / verified learning / pre-action path. No second archive, memory service, daemon, vector DB, merge, canon change, or RAW archive rewrite. TDD/behavioral acceptance required: T1-T10, context reduction with decision parity, stale rejection, OWNER-lock retention, verified lesson transfer, cold-start handoff, delta-only output.\n\nR02 NOTE: this candidate remains unmerged and on its original sandbox base. Independent Night School law-enforcement work proceeds separately from current main because the authoritative `scripts/duncan_night_archive.py` Fortress path is not present on this stale sandbox base; no replacement infrastructure is being created.",
